---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <p>Raj Oracle's technical learning journal</p>
      <h1>Learn. Build. Document.</h1>
      <p>
        I document what I learn by building software, exploring data,
        and experimenting with AI. Here you will find practical notes,
        tutorials, and lessons from projects.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/blog/">Explore my articles &rarr;</a></p>

      <h2>What I am learning</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Python and software engineering:</strong> FastAPI, testing, and architecture.</li>
        <li><strong>AI and RAG:</strong> language models, retrieval, and evaluation.</li>
        <li><strong>Data engineering:</strong> SQL, pipelines, and data platforms.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloud and DevOps:</strong> Docker, CI/CD, and observability.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Learning through practice</h2>
      <p>
        Each article aims to explain a problem, show an example,
        describe how it was checked, and capture what I learned.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/blog/starting-my-technical-learning-blog/">Read my first learning note &rarr;</a></p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
